  <name>Driver Manager</name>
  <summary>Hardware driver, firmware, and rollback manager for Fedora</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Driver Manager detects your hardware — graphics, Wi-Fi, audio, storage,
      and peripherals — shows which kernel drivers are in use, and recommends
      the right driver packages for Fedora Workstation.
    </p>
    <p>
      The Available Drivers page lists officially packaged drivers for your
      hardware with their repository versions, and installs them on demand.
    </p>
    <p>
      It also surfaces firmware updates via fwupd, reports Secure Boot status,
      and lets you review and roll back recent software transactions safely.
    </p>
  </description>
  <developer>
